{
  "_doc": "Seasonal design scheduler. Each season has a recurring yearly ACTIVE window [resume..pause] as MM-DD; a tagged design's ad groups are ENABLED inside the window and paused outside it. 'resume' is set ~2 MONTHS before the holiday so shoppers see (and Amazon ranks) the designs well ahead of demand; 'pause' is a few days after. 'keywords' auto-detect matching designs by title (see appctl season-suggest). 'asins' maps a design's ASIN to a season key. Edit via the app (Seasonal screen) or appctl season-tag / season-define.",
